<title>FRANCE: Bomb explodes by Algerian school, no casualties.</title>
<headline>Bomb explodes by Algerian school, no casualties.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bomb exploded on Monday outside a school for girls in El Harrach suburb, southeast of the capital Algiers, but there were no casualties and only slight material damage, residents said.</p>
<p>&quot;The bomb went off outside Ourida Meddad high school at El Harrach. The explosion caused only slight damage,&quot; one resident in the neighbourhood told Reuters by telephone.</p>
